WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:04.878
Unit five. Network and Internet Infrastructure!

2
00:00:05.803 --> 00:00:11.064
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:11.114 --> 00:00:14.952
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.002 --> 00:00:20.324
Today we learn about Network and Internet Infrastructure. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.050
Network. Say it with me. Network!

6
00:00:28.566 --> 00:00:32.033
Server. Say it with me. Server!

7
00:00:35.499 --> 00:00:39.066
Router. Say it with me. Router!

8
00:00:42.538 --> 00:00:47.065
IP address. Say it with me. IP address!

9
00:00:50.579 --> 00:00:54.345
Bandwidth. Say it with me. Bandwidth!

10
00:00:57.852 --> 00:01:02.185
Data packet. Say it with me. Data packet!

11
00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:09.863
Wi-Fi. Say it with me. Wi-Fi!

12
00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.934
Cloud. Say it with me. Cloud!

13
00:01:20.444 --> 00:01:35.529
A network connects devices, often through a router, so they can share information. A server stores data that a device requests using its IP address. Bandwidth affects how fast a data packet travels, whether over Wi-Fi or through the cloud.

14
00:01:35.579 --> 00:01:39.028
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:45.311
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:45.361 --> 00:01:46.511
Router!

17
00:01:47.344 --> 00:01:52.751
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:53.951
Wi-Fi!

19
00:01:54.945 --> 00:02:02.813
Did you know? Data sent over the internet is broken into tiny packets that can travel different paths before reassembling at your device!

20
00:02:02.863 --> 00:02:04.946
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:06.471 --> 00:02:15.672
Think and answer. What do you think happens when a website loads on your device?

22
00:02:15.722 --> 00:02:16.872
Great answer!

23
00:02:18.161 --> 00:02:23.564
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:23.614 --> 00:02:26.714
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

